            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tTFah",
              "name": "hl4",
              "fill": "$dark",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1104,
              "content": "油价跌破$100 道指大涨200点\nTrump停战信号提振市场",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "XxWv9",
              "name": "sb4",
              "fill": "#ECFDF5",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "padding": [
                12,
                16
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rU3Ym",
                  "name": "sbt4",
                  "fill": "$green",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1072,
                  "content": "Trump暗示伊朗战争可能在数周内结束，全球市场应声反弹。WTI原油收于$100.12/桶（跌1.24%），布伦特原油$101.16/桶（跌2.7%）。道琼斯指数4月首日大涨200点，投资者押注中东冲突即将结束。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "JD1sb",
              "name": "dv4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "$bdr"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "8w5ji",
              "name": "fh4",
              "fill": "$blue",
              "content": "📊 关键事实与数据",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "OZDTU",
              "name": "fa4",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pOgXs",
                  "name": "fa4t",
                  "fill": "$green",
                  "content": "油价走势",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UxmJm",
                  "name": "fa4b",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1104,
                  "content": "布伦特原油从峰值$126回落至$101，但仍比战前$70高出44%。3月原油录得历史最大单月涨幅。IEA 32国已释放4亿桶战略石油储备",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "yGGTe",
              "name": "fb4",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kWaf6",
                  "name": "fb4t",
                  "fill": "$green",
                  "content": "市场反应",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Hkmh8",
                  "name": "fb4b",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1104,
                  "content": "道指+200点开启4月。但分析师警告：霍尔木兹海峡仍未开放，停火尚无时间表，市场反弹可能只是\"希望交易\"而非基本面改善",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "B6rc1",
              "name": "dv4b",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "$bdr"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ARbX0",
              "name": "ih4",
              "fill": "$green",
              "content": "💡 深度洞察",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EFwne",
              "name": "ib4",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1104,
              "content": "油价从$126回落到$100是市场对\"战争即将结束\"的定价。但真正的风险在于：如果Trump的停战承诺再次落空，油价可能报复性反弹至$130+。当前市场是在交易预期，而非现实。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
