              "content": "美最高法院审理出生公民权\nTrump行政令或被推翻",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "GDG43",
              "name": "sb5",
              "fill": "$tag",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "padding": [
                12,
                16
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "6ETBt",
                  "name": "sbt5",
                  "fill": "$blue",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1072,
                  "content": "美国最高法院多数大法官对Trump政府取消出生公民权的行政令表示质疑，倾向于维护宪法第14修正案——在美国领土出生即自动获得公民身份的权利。这是Trump移民政策面临的最大法律挑战。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "WfJix",
              "name": "dv5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "$bdr"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Eea2k",
              "name": "fh5",
              "fill": "$blue",
              "content": "📊 关键事实与数据",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "zwSAC",
              "name": "fa5",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Szldl",
                  "name": "fa5t",
                  "fill": "$blue",
                  "content": "宪法争议",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "1wEAN",
                  "name": "fa5b",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1104,
                  "content": "宪法第14修正案（1868年）明确规定：\"所有在美国出生或归化的人，均为美国公民。\" Trump行政令试图限制非法移民子女的出生公民权，被多个联邦法院叫停",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "wStQU",
              "name": "fb5",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "P8XHk",
                  "name": "fb5t",
                  "fill": "$blue",
                  "content": "法院态度",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gTF0f",
                  "name": "fb5b",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1104,
                  "content": "多数大法官在口头辩论中对政府立场表示怀疑。如果裁定行政令违宪，将是Trump任期内最重大的司法挫败之一，影响数百万移民家庭",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ln3Nb",
              "name": "dv5b",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "$bdr"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Gh7kh",
              "name": "ih5",
              "fill": "$green",
              "content": "💡 深度洞察",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gwcMD",
              "name": "ib5",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1104,
              "content": "出生公民权是美国宪法最基本的权利之一，自1868年以来从未被推翻。此案的结果将定义行政权力与宪法权利的边界，对美国移民政策和数百万家庭产生深远影响。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
